a diverse set of house, R&B, soul, 2-step and bass.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10816,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"5B6xvS9DF-U","position":34,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Hudson Mohawke - Rising 5","track":{"id":"vdi4ohJKPaI","path":"/artists/hudson-mohawke/tracks/rising-5/","slug":"rising-5","title":"Rising 5","artist":{"slug":"hudson-mohawke","title":"Hudson Mohawke"},"artwork":"images/artists/hudson-mohawke/tracks/rising-5.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"cwCPIWm5Qp4","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Hudson Mohawke - Furnace Loop","track":{"id":"nnd1ykuZwsk","path":"/artists/hudson-mohawke/tracks/furnace-loop/","slug":"furnace-loop","title":"Furnace Loop","artist":{"slug":"hudson-mohawke","title":"Hudson Mohawke"},"artwork":"images/artists/hudson-mohawke/tracks/furnace-loop.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"LAzjZuvHcho","position":27,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Hudson Mohawke - Furnace Loop","track":{"id":"nnd1ykuZwsk","path":"/artists/hudson-mohawke/tracks/furnace-loop/","slug":"furnace-loop","title":"Furnace Loop","artist":{"slug":"hudson-mohawke","title":"Hudson Mohawke"},"artwork":"images/artists/hudson-mohawke/tracks/furnace-loop.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BDetsr-_b9I","slug":"154","tags":[1,15],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #154","artwork":"/images/episodes/154.jpg","content":"Joe Kay really displayed a crazy selection of music that will have you copying/pasting consistently within Google for some time. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are a lot of new tunes sprinkled with the 'feel-good' classics that we always connect to our sets. It's essential for us to keep educating you with the influences and how it all connects to where we are today. Spread this set to as many people as possible! More minds and ears need to hear this music!\n\n